        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo wav'awi'laga Simiyoni na Lawi, “Inywe mwandetelaga lu'duko na ku'v'av'ezya v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yi' ya V'akanaani na V'apelizi mbafufume. Iswe ku'li' v'adoo. V'enav'a u'lu' v'ikunganie ku'v'ezya wu'lu'gu' nanne, ene na mugana gwanne v'ose ku'lazimangu'ziwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi v'enav'o v'asu'mbana v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Vihe, yi'li' visoga ku'muv'ezezya ilu'mbu' liswe ki'ti' mulav'a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
